Copyright 2026 the OpenYield Fusion contributors.

This product includes software developed as part of OpenYield
(https://github.com/ShenShan123/OpenYield), licensed under Apache-2.0.

The experiment execution and result analysis core
(yield_estimation/evaluation/*) is used unmodified from the collaboration
branch https://github.com/Weize-Lin/OpenYield at commit
312f137e9ab960f1178f4991d9bf4675575e2f01.

This repository adds only the web workbench (server.py, public/), multi-circuit
suite orchestration, evidence/dataset endpoints, demo bundling (tools/), tests
and documentation. It does not modify upstream algorithms, device models or
failure criteria.

Integration note: the Fusion branch historically used 312f137. The integrated
workbench uses the current checkout through evaluation API version 1. Shared
suite replay and execution orchestration have been extended; algorithm strategies,
device models and failure criteria are preserved. Existing demo records retain
their original revisions. See README.md and INTEGRATION_REPORT.md.
